WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:25.540
I decide, let's say, sometimes, sometimes it's hard to do it, when, like every person, sometimes I feel I need to express things to a third person, to maybe hear another point of view, and to also be able to observe myself from another person's perspective.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:35.700
It's always good. So yes, I always do it. I always talk about it with my parents, with a friend, and it's very good.
